    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A desktop idle game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely manage your game windows and create your personalized desktop gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you handle other tasks, send heroes on parallel adventures in a fantasy world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop unique heroes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has a distinct appearance and fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes grow through adventures and tasks. You can freely change their points, equipment, and throwable items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also feed your heroes food, which provides various useful buffs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dynamic maps</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has unique mechanics, such as grinding mobs, farming, mining, selling items, divination, and challenging powerful bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the maps will also develop, and the rewards will become richer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispatch heroes to various maps to acquire resources and cleverly adjust strategies for better gains.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft useful items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock recipes through various means, gather materials, and crafted higher-level items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted items not only have unique functions but can also be sold for a better price in shops.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A desktop idle game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely manage your game windows and create your personalized desktop gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you handle other tasks, send heroes on parallel adventures in a fantasy world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop unique heroes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has a distinct appearance and fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes grow through adventures and tasks. You can freely change their points, equipment, and throwable items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also feed your heroes food, which provides various useful buffs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dynamic maps</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has unique mechanics, such as grinding mobs, farming, mining, selling items, divination, and challenging powerful bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the maps will also develop, and the rewards will become richer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispatch heroes to various maps to acquire resources and cleverly adjust strategies for better gains.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft useful items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock recipes through various means, gather materials, and crafted higher-level items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted items not only have unique functions but can also be sold for a better price in shops.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Deskeroes is a desktop idle game allows you to build and dispatch heroes to battle monsters, farm resources, mine, manage stores, and engage in other interesting activities within a fantasy world.",
